# Plan 4 Task 6, S1 (D46): org.teavm.jso, TeaVM's JavaScript interop, leaves the class library javac
# compiles against (compile-classlib-teavm.bin, "the SDK"). A box could `import org.teavm.jso.JSBody` and
# run any JavaScript in its worker, from there even import(), which no worker can remove (D86); the JDK
# has no such package. StdlibConverter builds the SDK from every jar of generateClassLib's classlibInput
# (teavm-classlib, teavm-jso, teavm-jso-apis) and already skipped org/teavm/jso/impl/; it now skips all of
# org/teavm/jso/, so the SDK holds no class of the package or its subpackages (277 entries before) and the
# module-info it generates exports none of them. javac then says what the JDK says: "package org.teavm.jso
# does not exist". The SDK classes that still name a jso type (package-private helpers in java.lang,
# java.nio and java.util that implement JSObject or TimerHandler, and two TeaVM-only public types,
# java.nio.ArrayBufferViewProvider and java.nio.JSBufferHelper$WasmGC) are never completed by ordinary
# code, and every gate passes without the package. The runtime classlib (runtime-classlib-teavm.bin,
# which buildTeaVMClassLib builds from the same jars) is unchanged: TeaVM's own classes use org.teavm.jso
# at run time (its console print streams, which teavm-0016 edits, and teavm-0012's Navigator), and a
# program's compiled code links against them there. classlibInput is left as it is because that same
# configuration feeds the runtime classlib.
#
# Written against teavm-javac's own tracked files (compiler/build.gradle, StdlibConverter.java), from the
# pinned JDK's observed output; no OpenJDK source was opened.
#
# Applies to: github.com/konsoletyper/teavm-javac 2ddcf02e (master, 2026-09-04)

diff --git a/compiler/src/main/java/org/teavm/javac/StdlibConverter.java b/compiler/src/main/java/org/teavm/javac/StdlibConverter.java
index 4b81bff..74ec518 100644
--- a/compiler/src/main/java/org/teavm/javac/StdlibConverter.java
+++ b/compiler/src/main/java/org/teavm/javac/StdlibConverter.java
@@ -43,7 +43,9 @@ public class StdlibConverter extends ClassVisitor {
     private static final String PREFIX = "org/teavm/classlib/java/";
     private static final String[] EXCLUDED = {
             "org/teavm/classlib/",
-            "org/teavm/jso/impl/",
+            // teavm-fork: all of org.teavm.jso, not only its impl package. TeaVM's JavaScript interop is not in
+            // the JDK, and a program that could name it (@JSBody) could run JavaScript; the runtime classlib keeps it.
+            "org/teavm/jso/",
             "org/teavm/platform",
             "java/nio/charset/impl/",
             "java/util/stream/impl",
